; Pin every npm command run inside this repo to the public registry. Project
; config outranks ~/.npmrc, so a machine whose userconfig points npm at a
; corporate registry proxy still reads, installs and publishes against npmjs
; here. Keep this pointing at the PUBLIC registry only: a private-registry pin
; committed here would poison the lockfile with tarball URLs no other machine
; can resolve, and leak a private hostname.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
